    WHAT A GOOD RUN LOOKS LIKE, per rule:

        Generating parse code for Search
        Search = CodE { return search() && followedBy() && GrouP() && SemI(); }
        ...
        compile succeeded for Search
        end compileRules

    A "Generating parse code for X" with no "X = CodE {...}" line after it means X
